    "title": "Final Movie in the Park of the Year Set for Tonight - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Melissa Jacobs ,\n1 days ago The community is invited to enjoy the final Movie in the Park of the year tonight, featuring Puss in Boots: The Last Wish. The movie will begin at dusk, with the start time expected to be between 7:45 and 8 p.m. as the sun sets earlier this time of year. Read full article",
